t actor (that is danjo — opposite posture)"]}, "displayNameEn" "Toritsugi", "cells" [{"name" "procedure_registry", "module" "toritsugi.cells.procedure-registry", "murakumoNode" "reuben", "phase" "continuous", "io" "maintain + resolve the coded procedure catalog (窓口/所管/様式/必要書類/手数料/法定処理期間/根拠法令/channel); enforce G14 verification status"} {"name" "eligibility_match", "module" "toritsugi.cells.eligibility-match", "murakumoNode" "reuben", "phase" "event", "io" "consenting member's life-event/profile (OWN data) → benefitMatch (proactive 'you may be eligible for X' — the LINE-like notify; never a third party)"} {"name" "intake", "module" "toritsugi.cells.intake", "murakumoNode" "reuben", "phase" "event", "io" "member consent + DID/SBT binding + need/life-event → procedureGuide session"} {"name" "guide", "module" "toritsugi.cells.guide", "murakumoNode" "gad", "phase" "event", "io" "pull chigiri procedure template + resolved procedure → step-by-step 案内 + 必要書類 checklist (UPL boundary G5)"} {"name" "draft", "module" "toritsugi.cells.draft", "murakumoNode" "gad", "phase" "event", "io" "assist filling the 様式/フォーム → applicationDraft artifact (member reviews + owns; assist, NOT 作成代理)"} {"name" "submit", "module" "toritsugi.cells.submit", "murakumoNode" "naphtali", "phase" "event", "io" "THE ONLY active-outbound cell — default hands the draft back for member self-submission; 代行 submission ONLY under G14+G15+R3 → submissionRecord"} {"name" "status_track", "module" "toritsugi.cells.status-track", "murakumoNode" "naphtali", "phase" "continuous", "io" "処理状況 / 法定処理期間 clock + follow-up + 結果 intake (ENCRYPTED PII, G6); refusal → lawful appeal route via chigiri"}], "descriptionJa" "kotoba-native の市民向け 行政手続きコンシェルジュ — 受動的な danjo(国家を監視)と himotoki(閲覧の権利を行使)に対する『サービス提供側』カウンターパート。toritsugi は 窓口 で『市民の側』に立ち、同意した信者を 自治体・政府手続き に伴走する(LINE 公式アカウントの役割)。利用可能な 制度/給付 を能動的に提示し、手続き を説明し、必要書類 チェックリストを整え、様式 の入力を補助して、最終的な 提出・署名 は 本人 が行う(案内 + 伴走 + 本人提出支援、既定モード)。gated な R3 例外として 本人同意ベース提出代行 — 本人の手続きに限り、明示的な提出ごとの同意 + DID/SBT + 行政書士法 clearance + Council Lv7+ の下で公式 channel に提出。各手続きの 窓口 / 所管(省庁・自治体)/ オンライン申請URL / 必要書類 / 様式 / 手数料 / 法定処理期間 / 根拠法令 / channel を コード化した procedure registry が駆動する。同意必須・本人手続き限定(G3)、透明かつ pretext 禁止・本人が申請者本人(G4)、行政書士法/UPL 境界(G5、法的・税務助言なし + 作成代理なし → chigiri + 有資格者)、PII 暗号化(G6)、Murakumo-only 推論(G7)、捏造禁止・根拠法令+provenance 明示(G8)、非営利(G9)、適法 channel のみ(G10)、Transparent Religious Force(G11)、検証済 procedure のみ提出(G14)、本人提出 default(G15、代行は gated R3)。日本先行(R0);architecture は jurisdiction 汎用。7 cells / 6 Lexicons / 15 gates / 14 non-goals。", "constitutionalDiscipline" {"transparentForce" "G11 — assist + submit + track ONLY; no coercion / extra-legal pressure; appeals via lawful 不服申立 (審査請求) routed to chigiri (ADR-2605192100 §1.12).", "memberSelfSubmissionDefault" "G15 — default mode is guide-the-member-to-submit-themselves; 代行 active-outbound (toritsugi_submit) is the GATED exception (R3), requiring explicit per-submission consent + 行政書士法 clearance + Council Lv7+.", "consentGatedOwnProcedureOnly" "G3 — every guide/draft/submission is member-initiated with explicit consent + Adherent-SBT/DID binding and concerns the member's OWN procedure; NEVER for a non-consenting person; NEVER a third party's procedure or data.", "transparentNonPretext" "G4 — the member is always the named 申請者本人; no impersonation / sockpuppet / false identity (§2(c)); toritsugi never represents itself as an official 自治体 channel (unofficial assistant).", "scopeMinimization" "G12 — collect only what the specific procedure requires; no fishing / profile-building beyond the active need.", "piiConfidentiality" "G6 — member PII + 申請内容 + 結果 land ONLY in com.etzhayyim.encrypted.* (XChaCha20-Poly1305, DID-bound to the member; ADR-2605181100); NEVER plaintext PII on MST.", "stateAlignedFlagPassthrough" "G13 — stateAlignedFlag pass-through into derived records.", "nonFabrication" "G8 — never invent 手続き/様式/根拠法令/手数料/期限; every procedure cites 根拠法令 + provenance; the member ALWAYS confirms before any submission; no hallucinated legal facts.", "murakumoOnlyInference" "G7 — Murakumo-only inference per ADR-2605215000; no vendor LLM API callout.", "nonCommercial" "G9 — non-profit; no paid filing-mill; no fee for the service (donation-only); no resale of member or 制度 data (Charter Rider §2(e)).", "lawfulChannelOnly" "G10 — the only external mutation is a lawful submission through an OFFICIAL channel WITH member authorization; never alters records; never unauthorized access / access-control circumvention; respects portal ToS + rate limits.", "verifiedProcedureOnlySubmission" "G14 — toritsugi_submit refuses any procedure whose verificationStatus is unverified-seed or whose lastVerified is stale; live filing requires maintainer-verified (public procedure) / council-verified (代行 path).", "gyouseishoshiUplBoundary" "G5 — toritsugi provides 情報提供 + 案内 + 入力補助 + 伴走; renders NO legal/tax advice and performs NO 官公署提出書類の作成代理 reserved to 行政書士/弁護士/税理士. Legal characterization + 作成代理 + appeals → chigiri + licensed counsel (Public Fund Council Lv6+); tax → toritate."}, "constitutionalGates" {"description" "15 immutable gates per ADR-2605312030 §4. Council Lv6+ supermajority + new ADR to amend.", "gates" {"G7" "Murakumo-only inference (ADR-2605215000)", "G13" "stateAlignedFlag pass-through into derived records", "G15" "Member-self-submission default — guide-the-member-to-submit is the default; 代行 active-outbound is the gated R3 exception (per-submission consent + 行政書士法 clearance + Council Lv7+)", "G11" "Transparent Religious Force discipline (§1.12) — assist + submit + track only; no coercion; lawful 不服申立 (審査請求) via chigiri", "G9" "No commercialization — non-profit; no paid filing-mill; donation-only; no resale of member/制度 data", "G10" "Lawful-channel-only — only external mutation is a lawful submission via an official channel with member authorization; never unauthorized access / circumvention", "G5" "行政書士法 / UPL-equivalent boundary — 案内 + 入力補助 + 伴走; NO legal/tax advice; NO 官公署提出書類の作成代理 → chigiri + lice